{"title": "Expanded Mineshaft", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:322px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ExpandedMineshaftMain.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedMineshaftMain.jpg/320px-ExpandedMineshaftMain.jpg?e0e26d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" class=\"thumbimage\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedMineshaftMain.jpg/480px-ExpandedMineshaftMain.jpg?e0e26d 1.5x, /images/thumb/ExpandedMineshaftMain.jpg/640px-ExpandedMineshaftMain.jpg?e0e26d 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a>  <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ExpandedMineshaftMain.jpg\" class=\"internal\" title=\"Enlarge\"></a></div>The main entrance of the Expanded Mineshaft.</div></div></div>\n<p>The <b>Expanded Mineshaft</b> is a variation of the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Interiors#The_Mineshaft_(more_info_needed)\">Mineshaft</a> that is similar in gameplay but is structurally different. It also adds several extra tiles. It commonly spawns on <a href=\"/wiki/Chasm\" title=\"Chasm\">Chasm</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Core\" title=\"Core\">Core</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Dreck\" title=\"Dreck\">Dreck</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Infernis\" title=\"Infernis\">Infernis</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Lecaro\" title=\"Lecaro\">Lecaro</a>.  It most commonly spawns on <a href=\"/wiki/Descent\" title=\"Descent\">Descent</a> and features a unique trial there instead of a <a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#&gt;_Secondary_Objectives\"><b>Secondary Objective</b></a>. \n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Rooms\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Rooms</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Secondary_Objectives\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Secondary Objectives</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Flick_the_Switches\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Flick the Switches</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Fuel_the_Generator\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Fuel the Generator</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Dissolve_the_Webs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dissolve the Webs</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Rewards\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Rewards</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Rooms\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Rooms\">&gt; Rooms</span></h2>\n<ul><li><b>Locked Storage</b> - A room with several lockers, benches, and hangers behind a special locked door. Typically spawns close to the main entrance and requires completing a <a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#&gt;_Secondary_Objectives\"><b>Secondary Objective</b></a> to open.</li>\n<li><b>Conveyor Belt</b> - A room with a conveyor belt that typically spawns near the main entrance.</li>\n<li><b>Pressure Management</b> - A room with many pipes inside of it.</li>\n<li><b>Cave-In</b> - Some hallways have dead ends as a result of a cave-in.</li>\n<li><b>Coal Storage</b> - A room with many containers of coal.</li>\n<li><b>Minecart Storage</b> - An area with many minecarts placed on the tracks.</li>\n<li><b>Furnace</b> - A room with a furnace in it and coal nearby. Two furnaces can also spawn across from each other in hallways.</li>\n<li><b>Lifts</b> - Areas with smaller lifts likely used for transporting materials and supplies up and down. Falling to the bottom kills the player.</li>\n<li><b>Chasm</b> - A broken pathway above a large chasm that must be jumped over. Falling to the bottom kills the player.</li>\n<li><b>Spider Cave</b> - A pathway in the caves leading to a pit with several webs, eggs, and a Bunker Spider on the other side. This room always generates but is only accessible through normal means if the <a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Dissolve_the_Webs\"><b>Dissolve the Webs</b></a> objective is generated.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Secondary_Objectives\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Secondary_Objectives\">&gt; Secondary Objectives</span></h2>\n<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:322px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ExpandedMineshaftLockedStorageDoor.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedMineshaftLockedStorageDoor.jpg/320px-ExpandedMineshaftLockedStorageDoor.jpg?3161a7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" class=\"thumbimage\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedMineshaftLockedStorageDoor.jpg/480px-ExpandedMineshaftLockedStorageDoor.jpg?3161a7 1.5x, /images/thumb/ExpandedMineshaftLockedStorageDoor.jpg/640px-ExpandedMineshaftLockedStorageDoor.jpg?3161a7 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a>  <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ExpandedMineshaftLockedStorageDoor.jpg\" class=\"internal\" title=\"Enlarge\"></a></div>The Locked Storage door with the Gas tank for the Fuel the Generator objective next to it.</div></div></div><p>One of three unique objectives will randomly generate for players to complete for one of three valuable rewards that spawns in the <b>Locked Storage</b> room.\n</p><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Flick_the_Switches\">Flick the Switches</span></h3>\n<p>Players must find two panels of switches in the main area of the mineshaft. Players must flick up all the switches that have a wire connected to a red light and flick down all other switches. A sound effect will play and the panel can no longer be interacted with if successful.\n</p><p>After both panels are turned on, a sound effect will be heard and players can return to and open the <b>Locked Storage</b> for their reward.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Fuel_the_Generator\">Fuel the Generator</span></h3>\n<p>If a <b>Gas tank</b> spawns next to the <b>Locked Storage</b> door, players must bring it to a yellow generator with its light on somewhere in the caves. Players must pour the gas into the funnel on the machine connected to the generator.\n</p><p>After the gas has been poured, a sound effect will play and players can return to and open the <b>Locked Storage</b> for their reward.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dissolve_the_Webs\">Dissolve the Webs</span></h3>\n<p>If webs are above or around the <b>Locked Storage</b> door, players must find the now accessible <b>Spider Cave</b> in the caves. Players must cross the pit to reach the other side with the Bunker Spider, several webs, and several eggs. A web on a pipe that periodically sparks can be interacted with to remove it at the end of the room.\n</p><p>If successful, a sound effect will play and players can return to and open the <b>Locked Storage</b> for their reward.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rewards\">Rewards</span></h3>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Expanded Mineshaft Secondary Rewards\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Scrap Name</th>\n<th>Image</th>\n<th>Conductive</th>\n<th>Weight (lbs)</th>\n<th>Base Value</th>\n<th>Minimum Value</th>\n<th>Minimum Solo Value</th>\n<th>Maximum Value</th>\n<th>Maximum Solo Value\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bucket of coal</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bucket_of_coal.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Bucket of coal.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Bucket_of_coal.png/60px-Bucket_of_coal.png?515703\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Bucket_of_coal.png/90px-Bucket_of_coal.png?515703 1.5x, /images/thumb/Bucket_of_coal.png/120px-Bucket_of_coal.png?515703 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>160</td>\n<td>160</td>\n<td>187</td>\n<td>183</td>\n<td>214\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bucket of iron</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bucket_of_iron.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Bucket of iron.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Bucket_of_iron.png/60px-Bucket_of_iron.png?f3e876\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Bucket_of_iron.png/90px-Bucket_of_iron.png?f3e876 1.5x, /images/thumb/Bucket_of_iron.png/120px-Bucket_of_iron.png?f3e876 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>270</td>\n<td>270</td>\n<td>315</td>\n<td>310</td>\n<td>362\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bucket of gold</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bucket_of_gold.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Bucket of gold.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Bucket_of_gold.png/60px-Bucket_of_gold.png?1f52af\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Bucket_of_gold.png/90px-Bucket_of_gold.png?1f52af 1.5x, /images/thumb/Bucket_of_gold.png/120px-Bucket_of_gold.png?1f52af 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>420</td>\n<td>420</td>\n<td>491</td>\n<td>482</td>\n<td>583\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p>The reward is randomized, but the chance for a more valuable reward is increased by how early in the day players complete the objective and is influenced by <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics#Furniture_luck\">the vanilla luck system</a>. The value of the reward is additionally increased by a difficulty multiplier, ranging from 0.6x to 1.4x, and a solo (singleplayer) multiplier of 1.17x. <b>Fuel the Generator</b> is considered Easy difficulty and has a 1.0x multiplier. <b>Flick the Switches</b> and <b>Dissolve the Webs</b> are considered Medium difficulty and have a 1.15x multiplier.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Gallery\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Gallery\">&gt; Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ExpandedMineshaftConveyor.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The room with a conveyor belt.\"><img alt=\"The room with a conveyor belt.\" src=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedMineshaftConveyor.jpg/120px-ExpandedMineshaftConveyor.jpg?f90b79\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedMineshaftConveyor.jpg/180px-ExpandedMineshaftConveyor.jpg?f90b79 1.5x, /images/thumb/ExpandedMineshaftConveyor.jpg/240px-ExpandedMineshaftConveyor.jpg?f90b79 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The room with a conveyor belt.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ExpandedMineshaftPressure.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The pressure management room.\"><img alt=\"The pressure management room.\" src=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedMineshaftPressure.jpg/120px-ExpandedMineshaftPressure.jpg?c81ed6\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedMineshaftPressure.jpg/180px-ExpandedMineshaftPressure.jpg?c81ed6 1.5x, /images/thumb/ExpandedMineshaftPressure.jpg/240px-ExpandedMineshaftPressure.jpg?c81ed6 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The pressure management room.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ExpandedMineshaftCaveIn.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"A hallway blocked by a cave-in.\"><img alt=\"A hallway blocked by a cave-in.\" src=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedMineshaftCaveIn.jpg/120px-ExpandedMineshaftCaveIn.jpg?441158\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedMineshaftCaveIn.jpg/180px-ExpandedMineshaftCaveIn.jpg?441158 1.5x, /images/thumb/ExpandedMineshaftCaveIn.jpg/240px-ExpandedMineshaftCaveIn.jpg?441158 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">A hallway blocked by a cave-in.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ExpandedMineshaftCoal.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"A room with coal containers.\"><img alt=\"A room with coal containers.\" src=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedMineshaftCoal.jpg/120px-ExpandedMineshaftCoal.jpg?58d4d3\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedMineshaftCoal.jpg/180px-ExpandedMineshaftCoal.jpg?58d4d3 1.5x, /images/thumb/ExpandedMineshaftCoal.jpg/240px-ExpandedMineshaftCoal.jpg?58d4d3 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">A room with coal containers.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ExpandedMineshaftMinecarts.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"An area with many minecarts.\"><img alt=\"An area with many minecarts.\" src=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedMineshaftMinecarts.jpg/120px-ExpandedMineshaftMinecarts.jpg?825c87\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedMineshaftMinecarts.jpg/180px-ExpandedMineshaftMinecarts.jpg?825c87 1.5x, /images/thumb/ExpandedMineshaftMinecarts.jpg/240px-ExpandedMineshaftMinecarts.jpg?825c87 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">An area with many minecarts.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ExpandedMineshaftFurnace1.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"A room with a furnace.\"><img alt=\"A room with a furnace.\" src=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedMineshaftFurnace1.jpg/120px-ExpandedMineshaftFurnace1.jpg?e54828\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedMineshaftFurnace1.jpg/180px-ExpandedMineshaftFurnace1.jpg?e54828 1.5x, /images/thumb/ExpandedMineshaftFurnace1.jpg/240px-ExpandedMineshaftFurnace1.jpg?e54828 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">A room with a furnace.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ExpandedMineshaftFurnace2.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"Two furnaces across from each other.\"><img alt=\"Two furnaces across from each other.\" src=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedMineshaftFurnace2.jpg/120px-ExpandedMineshaftFurnace2.jpg?ef3c19\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedMineshaftFurnace2.jpg/180px-ExpandedMineshaftFurnace2.jpg?ef3c19 1.5x, /images/thumb/ExpandedMineshaftFurnace2.jpg/240px-ExpandedMineshaftFurnace2.jpg?ef3c19 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Two furnaces across from each other.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ExpandedMineshaftLift.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"A small area with a lift going into a pit.\"><img alt=\"A small area with a lift going into a pit.\" src=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedMineshaftLift.jpg/120px-ExpandedMineshaftLift.jpg?a9653a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ExpandedMineshaftLift.jpg/180px-ExpandedMineshaftLift.jpg?a9653a 1.5x, /images/thumb/ExpandedMineshaftLift.jpg/240px-ExpandedMineshaftLift.jpg?a9653a 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">A small area with a lift going into a pit.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ExpandedMineshaftChasm.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"A broken pathway above a chasm.\"><img alt=\"A broken pathway above a chasm.\" src=\"/